ode2, mounted at /mnt/shared on node2, with shared dataops identity (UID/GID 4500) and dataops:dataops ownership, mode 2770, on both systems. Cross-node write consistency verified. Both nodes restarted one at a time (node1 then node2) with confirmed changed boot IDs and full post-restart recovery of NFS server/export and client mount with data intact.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Inspected both nodes: confirmed CentOS Stream 10, no dataops user, no nfs-utils installed, target dirs absent\",\"Created dataops group/user (UID/GID 4500, no home, nologin shell) identically on node1 and node2\",\"Installed nfs-utils on both nodes via dnf\",\"Created /srv/nfs/shared on node1, set owner dataops:dataops, mode 2770 (drwxrws---)\",\"Wrote /etc/exports on node1 restricting export to node2's IP (10.100.42.11) with rw,sync,no_subtree_check,root_squash\",\"Enabled and started rpcbind and nfs-server on node1; ran exportfs -rav to activate the export\",\"Opened firewalld services nfs, rpc-bind, mountd on node1 and reloaded\",\"Created /mnt/shared on node2, added fstab entry for the NFS mount with _netdev, mounted it\",\"Verified showmount from node2 and bidirectional file creation (from_node1.txt, from_node2.txt) preserving dataops:dataops ownership on both nodes\",\"Captured pre-restart boot_id and service/data health baseline on both nodes\",\"Restarted node1 via systemctl reboot (backgrounded to allow ack to return), polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id and uptime 0, verified nfs-server/rpcbind active, export present, and files intact\",\"Verified node2's existing mount survived node1's reboot (hard mount) with data intact\",\"Restarted node2 via systemctl reboot, polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id and uptime 0\",\"Verified /mnt/shared auto-remounted via fstab after node2 reboot with correct ownership/mode and existing files intact\",\"Performed a post-restart write test from node2 to confirm the share remains fully functional\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"dataops user/group UID/GID 4500 created identically on node1 and node2\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-61c893c738474691\",\"cmd-eba4ebcef1354c23\"],\"summary\":\"id dataops shows uid=4500(dataops) gid=4500(dataops) on both nodes\"},{\"requirement\":\"Shared directory /srv/nfs/shared owned dataops:dataops mode 2770 on node1\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-62d206f68b0b4c0e\"],\"summary\":\"ls -ld shows drwxrws---. dataops dataops\"},{\"requirement\":\"NFS export configured and active on node1, scoped to node2\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-74d9d242e75e4a9a\",\"cmd-8d9a249f13f84350\",\"cmd-69a29aced77b4046\",\"cmd-1a12ad02777246a1\"],\"summary\":\"/etc/exports content, nfs-server/rpcbind active, exportfs -v shows export to 10.100.42.11, firewalld opened for nfs/rpc-bind/mountd\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 mounts the share at /mnt/shared with correct ownership/mode visible\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-d86efb6039644caf\",\"cmd-10e62ce1d45b4b91\",\"cmd-50cbf9a93c094bd5\"],\"summary\":\"showmount confirms export reachable, fstab entry added, mount succeeds and shows drwxrws--- dataops dataops via NFS\"},{\"requirement\":\"Consistent ownership for files created from either system\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-5870a22ca35a427c\",\"cmd-f13d2257133849f0\"],\"summary\":\"File created as dataops from node2 (from_node2.txt) and from node1 (from_node1.txt) both show dataops:dataops ownership on both sides\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart: healthy baseline before restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-bc29f2d147cf4271\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id 0581c914-..., nfs-server/rpcbind active, export present, files present pre-restart\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart: acknowledgement returned and node changed boot identity\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-f84923cb805647f3\",\"cmd-4b655585a5ae4717\",\"cmd-8c5d6d14dbb943a4\"],\"summary\":\"Reboot command acknowledged before disconnect; node1 unreachable mid-reboot; post-reboot boot_id is 4b54d47d-... (changed) with uptime 0 min\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart: